      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "portraits/undead/lich.webp~SCALE(93, 93)",
            text: _("You can now advance dark sorcerers to liches! For the rest of the campaign, you can also right-click on an existing necromancer to turn it into a lich as long as it is in a castle. If the necromancer has gained enough experience, it will immediately level into an ancient lich!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("We have conquered death! Let us bring the news back to Wesnoth! Let all in this world know that nobody ever need die again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("I was planning to go that direction myself, so I have no objection. But, let us not go over those wretched mountain passes again. These tunnels should connect to the realm of Knalga and take us there directly."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("Why would the dwarvish empire abandon an outpost like this?"),
          },
          {
